              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikunyak kiŋaren koany iinacan ice iarei, Yakob okoku loka Sebedayo, ka Yokana onaceke, lukejaas ataker nepepe ka Sebedayo papakec, erucete iboyanakec; konyarau kes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
